This fixture is DISTRIBUTION-ONLY. It must never be copied to a consumer.

Its subject is invariant I108 inside scripts/validate-enforcement-map.sh, which install.sh
does not ship. A fixture whose subject is absent cannot fail on a consumer's tree, and a unit
that cannot fail scores as a pass in that consumer's own suite verdict.

It is also a MUTATION BATTERY in two directions: it edits throwaway copies of core's role
files AND throwaway copies of the validator's own arm, to score the wrong fixes the arm could
have been written as.
